Het WRC3-gccc-sys-relaxed
"Heterogeneous WRC3-gccc-sys-relaxed: per-proc device assignment gpu,cpu,cpu,cpu (cpu=AArch64, gpu=LISA)"
{
1:X3=y;
1:X4=z;
2:X0=x;
2:X4=z;
3:X0=x;
}
 P0:gpu              | P1:cpu      | P2:cpu      | P3:cpu      ;
 r[relaxed,sys] r0 x | LDR W1,[X3] | LDR W1,[X4] | MOV W1,#1   ;
 w[relaxed,sys] y 1  | MOV W2,#1   | LDR W2,[X0] | STR W1,[X0] ;
                     | STR W2,[X4] |             |             ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P0)))
exists (0:r0=1 /\ 1:X1=1 /\ 2:X1=1 /\ 2:X2=0)
